dropped the body of (?!system-header function '(operator(\*|/|<<|>>)=|operator\())
--
Was KNOWNBUG with the headers of libstdc++ 16 (gcc 16) only: std::find's
predicate (predefined_ops.h `_Comp_with_val') holds the functor by value or by
reference according to `__by_ref_or_value_fn' = is_empty<equal_to<>>; with
`__is_empty' unconditionally false the empty functor was held by reference to a
temporary and every comparison read garbage.  Fixed in round 161
(cpp11_class_property_type_traits).  Runs where the host gcc is >= 16 (tag
libstdcxx16).
The compound-assignment and conversion operators of <bits/max_size_type.h>
(unsigned __int128 arithmetic, named by the ranges machinery but not called
here) are still
dropped; the forbidden pattern excludes exactly those.
